Bundled sample document
========================

PairedX ships one sample paper so the app has something to open on first run:

  "BERT: Pre-training of Deep Bidirectional Transformers for Language Understanding"
  Jacob Devlin, Ming-Wei Chang, Kenton Lee, Kristina Toutanova
  Proceedings of NAACL-HLT 2019, pages 4171–4186. Association for Computational Linguistics.

  Source:  https://aclanthology.org/N19-1423/
  License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The PDF (assets/sample-pdf.js) is bundled unmodified. The sample notes that ship
alongside it (assets/sample-notes.js) are PairedX's own commentary added to
demonstrate the app; they are not part of, or endorsed by, the paper's authors.

Bundled webfonts
================

