CDN, so that visiting PairedX makes no third-party requests. All three are
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org):

  Source Serif 4   — Copyright 2014-2023 Adobe (https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-serif)
  Public Sans      — Copyright 2015 Impallari Type; USWDS (https://github.com/uswds/public-sans)
  JetBrains Mono   — Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
                     (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono)

The files in assets/fonts/ are the unmodified latin and latin-ext woff2 subsets
as distributed by Google Fonts.

